{"availability":"available","full":"npapatheodorou/xbs-pwa","name":"xbs-pwa","description":"Unofficial read-only PWA client for xBrowserSync — the iOS/Android homescreen app it never had. Bookmarks are decrypted on-device with the Web Crypto API; your password never leaves the browser. Plain HTML/CSS/JS, zero runtime dependencies, no backend, deploys to Netlify as a static site.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-24T11:52:40Z","updated":"2026-09-15T10:58:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://xbs-pwa.vercel.app/","topics":["android","bookmarks","end-to-end-encryption","ios","netlify","pwa","web-crypto","xbrowsersync","zero-dependency"],"demo":"https://xbs-pwa.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T15:45:19.137Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T15:45:19.137Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T15:45:19.137Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:11:48.043Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T09:00:59.452Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T11:00:33.388Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T15:45:19.137Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A small, installable, read-only mobile client for xBrowserSync — the anonymous, end-to-end-encrypted bookmark sync tool. It exists because there is no official iOS app; this runs from the iOS or Android homescreen instead.","It is a static site with zero runtime dependencies: plain HTML, CSS and ES modules. Nothing is bundled, minified or transpiled.","This is an unofficial third-party client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the xBrowserSync project. Bugs here are mine, not theirs — please do not report them to the xBrowserSync issue tracker."],"features":["Anyone who can read your device storage learns your sync ID, whether or not","If you stay signed in, they can also decrypt your bookmarks, because the key"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/npapatheo